# Private pristine floor resource selector — frozen, unexecuted

This new proposal targets only `tests/acts/act1/a1_l3_full_parent_candidate.gd`. Its actual 523-line base is SHA `ff60f9974cf5a3e48152b4aa744c7263707ffcbb6254986e7b085a00dbd023e6` (the owner task's `744b` spelling was a transcription error; actual bytes contain `744c`). The optional `--floor-resource-guards-only` branch stops after genuine initial paused entry, before GUI Resume or any gameplay. Default 665-check prefix/Warning/candidate/Continue/Retry behavior is preserved; the original `33` methods other than `_run`/`_finish` are byte-identical. Removing the selector assignment/early branch reproduces the original `_run` exactly; `_finish` changes only conditional report scope/mode and printed summary. The ten-minute watchdog, native waits, cleanup and global settings/audio restoration remain original. No new resource/class/UID/import is needed.

